{
  "name": "Clean a Google Sheets email list with ClearBounce",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Clean a Google Sheets email list with ClearBounce\n\nReads every row of a sheet, verifies all addresses in **one ClearBounce bulk job** (duplicates are charged once) and writes `status`, `reason` and `score` back to each row.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Your sheet needs an `email` column plus empty `status`, `reason` and `score` columns.\n2. Pick the spreadsheet and sheet in both Google Sheets nodes.\n3. Create a ClearBounce API credential with a live key (`cb_live_`). Bulk jobs cost 1 credit per unique address.\n4. Click **Execute workflow**.\n\nInvalid or empty addresses are skipped for free and marked `invalid_syntax`.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "b2e4d3e1-0002-4d2f-8b20-000000000001",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "b2e4d3e1-0002-4d2f-8b20-000000000002",
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        320,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2e4d3e1-0002-4d2f-8b20-000000000003",
      "name": "Read Contacts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        540,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "bulkJob",
        "email": "={{ $json.email }}"
      },
      "id": "b2e4d3e1-0002-4d2f-8b20-000000000004",
      "name": "Verify All Emails",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-clearbounce.clearBounce",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "row_number": "={{ $('Read Contacts').item.json.row_number }}",
            "status": "={{ $json.status }}",
            "reason": "={{ $json.reason }}",
            "score": "={{ $json.score }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "row_number"
          ],
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "email",
              "displayName": "email",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "removed": false
            },
            {
              "id": "status",
              "displayName": "status",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "removed": false
            },
            {
              "id": "reason",
              "displayName": "reason",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "removed": false
            },
            {
              "id": "score",
              "displayName": "score",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "removed": false
            },
            {
              "id": "row_number",
              "displayName": "row_number",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "number",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "readOnly": true,
              "removed": false
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2e4d3e1-0002-4d2f-8b20-000000000005",
      "name": "Write Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        980,
